{"chunkId": "25559b34-c184-5a10-b9d1-21de719fc6e4", "text": "画线/高亮：用荧光笔或下划线标记阅读材料中认为重要的内容，以帮助注意和后续复习。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-highlighting", "strategyName": "画线/高亮", "chunkType": "definition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.2, "communityScore": 0.8, "effectivenessScore": 0.2, "overallScore": 0.4, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}}}
{"chunkId": "8066ea8d-1384-599a-a521-90f7d48b8390", "text": "画线/高亮的第 1 步：阅读学习材料。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-highlighting", "strategyName": "画线/高亮", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.2, "communityScore": 0.8, "effectivenessScore": 0.2, "overallScore": 0.4, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 1, "totalSteps": 3}}
