{"chunkId": "e0eb212a-36e7-5389-907d-9aa6b5b693ad", "text": "画线/高亮适合需要快速定位关键信息的大致浏览，原因是：画线可以帮助学习者在初次接触材料时快速识别重要内容的位置。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-highlighting", "strategyName": "画线/高亮", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.2, "communityScore": 0.8, "effectivenessScore": 0.2, "overallScore": 0.4, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要快速定位关键信息的大致浏览"}}
{"chunkId": "74c3bc03-2c85-5585-b029-b44849ddc715", "text": "画线/高亮不适合需要深度理解和长期记忆的任务，原因是：大量研究表明画线对理解力和记忆保持几乎没有显著帮助，效果与单纯阅读无异。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-highlighting", "strategyName": "画线/高亮", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.2, "communityScore": 0.8, "effectivenessScore": 0.2, "overallScore": 0.4, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要深度理解和长期记忆的任务"}}
{"chunkId": "620a9952-498d-50e9-9ecf-0a2adde76ea2", "text": "画线/高亮不适合材料本身已有关键信息标记的情况，原因是：当材料中已有预标记时，额外画线不再带来额外收益。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-highlighting", "strategyName": "画线/高亮", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.2, "communityScore": 0.8, "effectivenessScore": 0.2, "overallScore": 0.4, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "材料本身已有关键信息标记的情况"}}
